ds per dollar rate, which would be the reciprocal at roughly 0.2083 GBP per USD.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_31b08ba6d2d0479e","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://fraser.stlouisfed.org/title/treasury-bulletin-407/october-1960-6766?page=15\" 2>/dev/null | grep -A100 \"1948\\|1949\\|1950\" | head -50"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
